  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity of CSOs in Upper Egyp</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The action aims at strengthening the capacity of at least 30 local CSOs in the governorates of Beni Suef, Fayoum, Luxor, Aswan and North and South Sinai through a combination of sub-grant and capacity building support. The sub-granting programme will serve to address a set of priorities including but not limited to: local governance, employment and income generation, civic participation, women and youth empowerment, inclusion of persons with disabilities (PwDs), digitalization and sustainable development. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
